factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 5 problems
  The article says the protest was held in the municipality (நகராட்சி) with a waiting protest at the municipal office; the draft's slides say 'அலுவலகத்தில் பரபரப்பு குறைந்தது' (tension decreased in the office), which is not stated in the article.
  The reel_script says 'த வெ க நிர்வாகிகள்' (TVK administrators/office-bearers) came to support; the article says 'த.வெ.க.,வினர்' (TVK members/cadres), not specifically administrators, a role change.
  The reel_script says the two sides held talks 'தனித்தனியாக' (separately); the article says talks were held by two groups coming in, with each side talking, which is roughly consistent, but the caption's 'இரண்டு தரப்பினராக' phrasing is grammatically unclear and mixes the TVK and contractor parties into one sentence.
  The caption says the workers 'போராட்டத்தை கைவிட்டு' (gave up the protest) and the slide says workers 'போராட்டத்தை கைவிட்டனர'; the article only says they dispersed after compromise, so 'gave up the protest' is a slight embellishment.
  The reel_script says 'பணியாளர் போராட்டம்' and the slide says 'முடிவு' with 'அலுவலகத்தில் பரபரப்பு' while the article's main fact is that the protest itself created a stir (பரபரப்பு); the reel omits that the protest caused a commotion.
